     3	def car_race_collision(n: int):
     4	    """
     5	    Imagine a road that's a perfectly straight infinitely long line.
     6	    n cars are driving left to right;  simultaneously, a different set of n cars
     7	    are driving right to left.   The two sets of cars start out being very far from
     8	    each other.  All cars move in the same speed.  Two cars are said to collide
     9	    when a car that's moving left to right hits a car that's moving right to left.
    10	    However, the cars are infinitely sturdy and strong; as a result, they continue moving
    11	    in their trajectory as if they did not collide.
    12	
    13	    This function outputs the number of such collisions.
    14	    """
