  ✓ Stage 1: verify input, record-layout, campaign-lock, and provenance integrity
  ✓ Stage 2: assess program fidelity and run independent differential tests
  ✓ Stage 3: perform clean semantics/proof rebuild and concrete executions
  ✓ Stages 4–5: audit claim adequacy, real-program pinning, and every local rule
  ✓ Stage 6: create and run a fresh meaningful non-vacuity mutation
